WEBVTT

00:00:01.070 --> 00:00:02.890
The Digital World,

00:00:02.890 --> 00:00:06.020
a world inhabited by unusual 
creatures called Digimon.

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:09.950
It has been conquered 
by the evil Bagra Army

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:14.530
and divided into seven Kingdoms 
ruled by seven Death Generals.

00:00:15.170 --> 00:00:18.230
Taiki Kudou has leapt 
into these seven Kingdoms

00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:22.080
along with his partner, 
Shoutmon, to save the Digimon.

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:25.700
This is the story of the 
friendship and adventures

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:28.540
shared by Taiki, his friends, 
and the Digimon.

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.040
We were thrown into Hell's Field,

00:01:54.040 --> 00:01:56.560
a world that favors only evil Digimon.

00:01:56.560 --> 00:02:00.670
There, the big life-or-death showdown 
between me and Yuu began.

00:02:01.290 --> 00:02:06.070
To bring Yuu, who's convinced 
that it's all a game, to his senses,

00:02:06.070 --> 00:02:09.540
Kiriha sacrificed himself 
so that I could move on.

00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:16.310
This is how we have won our 
way through to this point.

00:02:17.540 --> 00:02:20.690
By risking our lives on the 
power of our friendship!

00:02:21.390 --> 00:02:23.920
So I can use X5, too.

00:02:23.920 --> 00:02:27.130
This is the new power of the 
friendship between us all.

00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:28.930
Greymon!

00:02:30.160 --> 00:02:31.900
MailBirdramon!

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:34.230
DigiXros!

00:02:35.510 --> 00:02:37.370
DigiXros!

00:02:37.370 --> 00:02:40.460
MetalGreymon!

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:43.980
After boosting the power of 
our friendship through battle,

00:02:43.980 --> 00:02:47.530
we gained the ability to DigiXros 
each other's Digimon.

00:02:48.510 --> 00:02:50.420
In a new formation with me in 
charge of Kiriha's MetalGreymon

00:02:50.420 --> 00:02:54.650
and Nene leading Shoutmon X5, 
we broke through the enemy lines.

00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:57.890
Our surprise attack to get me inside

00:02:57.890 --> 00:02:59.360
Yuu's Black castle was successful.

00:02:59.930 --> 00:03:03.660
But then, Yuu picked up 
a sword and attacked me!

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:06.700
Yuu!

00:03:06.700 --> 00:03:08.340
I can't lose.

00:03:08.340 --> 00:03:09.860
I don't want to lose.

00:03:10.320 --> 00:03:12.370
It's the final showdown.

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:15.410
The number one General is me!

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:24.430
<b>Taiki vs. Yuu,</b>

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:24.430
<b>the Boy Generals Face Off!!</b>

00:03:18.430 --> 00:03:19.990
Taiki vs. Yuu,

00:03:19.990 --> 00:03:22.190
the Boy Generals Face Off!!

00:03:28.380 --> 00:03:31.890
L-Looks like we've won.

00:03:31.890 --> 00:03:33.740
You won't admit defeat?

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:36.450
The one-on-one battle 
between Sir Yuu

00:03:36.450 --> 00:03:37.990
and Master Taiki will soon begin.

00:03:37.990 --> 00:03:40.770
Sir Yuu will not hesitate to kill.

00:03:40.770 --> 00:03:43.020
But what about Master Taiki?

00:03:47.270 --> 00:03:49.270
S-Stop! Stop this, Yuu!

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:02.320
<i>How is he such a good swordsman?!</i>

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:03.740
<i>He might be better than Zenjirou!</i>

00:04:03.990 --> 00:04:05.220
You're too slow!

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:12.720
If that's the best the General can do,

00:04:12.720 --> 00:04:15.080
your surprise attack was a total waste.

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:17.720
You can say that again, Sir Yuu.

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:19.540
Apollomon!

00:04:19.840 --> 00:04:21.770
No... you're Whispered, aren't you?

00:04:21.770 --> 00:04:25.020
I'm honored to see that you remembered,

00:04:25.020 --> 00:04:26.640
naive little boy.

00:04:26.960 --> 00:04:29.230
You certainly put some 
thought into the plan

00:04:29.230 --> 00:04:30.830
to use each other's Digimon.

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:32.520
But this is as far as you go.

00:04:32.840 --> 00:04:35.920
I have already defeated the Kiriha boy.

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:38.680
I expect Lord DarkKnightmon 
and Lilithmon are finishing

00:04:38.680 --> 00:04:44.260
the battles near the 
White castle as we speak.

00:04:49.270 --> 00:04:51.380
I can't lose!

00:04:51.380 --> 00:04:53.050
For Taiki!

00:04:56.720 --> 00:04:58.640
Are you all right, Mervamon?

00:04:58.640 --> 00:04:59.580
Y-Yes.

00:04:59.580 --> 00:05:01.450
Hang in there. 
Trust Taiki and the others.

00:05:01.770 --> 00:05:04.270
That's all we can do right now.

00:05:05.010 --> 00:05:06.270
You know...

00:05:06.770 --> 00:05:10.190
I thought you were a silent, 
antisocial kind of guy.

00:05:10.190 --> 00:05:12.580
But you're surprisingly hot-blooded.

00:05:13.420 --> 00:05:16.510
What's with those two 
helping each other?

00:05:16.510 --> 00:05:17.730
How irritating!

00:05:17.730 --> 00:05:19.270
She's jealous.

00:05:19.270 --> 00:05:23.070
Seems like it's been a long time since 
Lady Lilithmon had a boyfriend.

00:05:23.620 --> 00:05:25.980
These things all over 
me are driving me nuts!

00:05:25.980 --> 00:05:28.370
If it's come to this, 
I'll just burn everything up!

00:05:28.370 --> 00:05:31.110
Just watch my massive explosion!

00:05:31.110 --> 00:05:32.380
Maybe she's never had 
a boyfriend at all?!

00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:39.890
Our defensive team is 
really under pressure.

00:05:44.180 --> 00:05:45.990
Shoutmon! Guys!

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:48.390
This is the end, Nene.

00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:53.100
Now our victory is within sight.

00:05:53.650 --> 00:05:57.870
You can take your time 
finishing him off, Sir Yuu.

00:05:58.400 --> 00:06:00.440
I'll go help out there.

00:06:01.440 --> 00:06:02.340
Sethmon?!

00:06:06.680 --> 00:06:08.380
Oh, sorry!

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:10.170
Now, Lord Apollomon,

00:06:10.170 --> 00:06:13.480
cast your divine judgment 
upon these foul rebels!

00:06:15.490 --> 00:06:17.890
Arrow of Whispered!

00:06:22.410 --> 00:06:23.790
There you have it.

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:25.300
I was a little worried there,

00:06:25.300 --> 00:06:27.330
but now our situations are fully reversed.

00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:30.890
Now all I have to do is defeat 
you, and it's all over.

00:06:36.680 --> 00:06:38.860
<i>Taiki... It's no use.</i>

00:06:38.860 --> 00:06:41.520
<i>He's not capable of being heartless.</i>

00:06:41.520 --> 00:06:42.910
<i>He can't kill Yuu.</i>

00:06:43.410 --> 00:06:46.650
<i>How can we stop Yuu?</i>

00:06:46.650 --> 00:06:50.790
I bet you thought I was just 
a clever but weak little boy,

00:06:50.790 --> 00:06:52.460
didn't you, Taiki?

00:06:52.460 --> 00:06:54.710
Well, sorry, but I am strong.

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:57.760
I've hidden that strength all my life.

00:06:58.800 --> 00:07:02.450
If I take things the least bit 
seriously, people start to cry.

00:07:02.450 --> 00:07:04.760
All my friends are weak,

00:07:04.760 --> 00:07:06.430
so I don't want to play with them.

00:07:06.430 --> 00:07:07.340
Y-Yuu...

00:07:07.340 --> 00:07:08.810
I hate living things, too.

00:07:08.810 --> 00:07:11.080
No matter how much I love 
them, they die so quickly.

00:07:15.650 --> 00:07:18.270
But this world is different.

00:07:18.270 --> 00:07:23.040
Back then... when my sister and 
I strayed into the Digital World,

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:25.360
DarkKnightmon told me...

00:07:27.160 --> 00:07:28.630
Yuu Amano.

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:31.530
I've come for you, as promised.

00:07:32.100 --> 00:07:34.230
Have you forgotten, Yuu?

00:07:35.380 --> 00:07:37.790
A world where no one dies or gets hurt,

00:07:38.440 --> 00:07:40.570
the world you wished for, is here.

00:07:40.570 --> 00:07:42.750
This is a game world,

00:07:42.750 --> 00:07:45.640
a virtual reality monster world.

00:07:45.640 --> 00:07:49.380
Come, take this and save the world.

00:07:49.380 --> 00:07:52.410
This is the beginning of 
the greatest game ever.

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:55.390
A game where I can save the world...

00:08:00.260 --> 00:08:02.830
The first Xros Loader that Nene had

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:05.030
was really yours, Yuu?

00:08:05.030 --> 00:08:07.720
In this world, nobody dies,

00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:10.420
and the friends who play 
with me never get hurt.

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:11.740
I can play to my heart's content.

00:08:12.100 --> 00:08:13.900
This place isn't real.

00:08:13.900 --> 00:08:16.570
It's a game world where 
everything is virtual.

00:08:16.930 --> 00:08:19.130
I was waiting for a world like this.

00:08:19.130 --> 00:08:22.280
I hate feeling sad and hurt.

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:25.920
<i>I see... so Yuu is actually kind.</i>

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:28.640
<i>Almost too kind...</i>

00:08:28.640 --> 00:08:32.800
<i>He's been venting those pent-up 
feelings in the Digital World.</i>

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:36.200
<i>That's why he was enjoying those 
cruel methods of fighting so much.</i>

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:37.760
<i>Trying to take hostages,</i>

00:08:37.760 --> 00:08:39.830
<i>trying to eliminate Nene...</i>

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:41.980
<i>We need Taiki to handle Yuu.</i>

00:08:41.980 --> 00:08:43.030
<i>Fight, Taiki!</i>

00:08:43.030 --> 00:08:46.820
<i>Shake off Yuu, and your own 
doubts along with him!</i>

00:08:47.810 --> 00:08:49.940
<i>I get it...</i>

00:08:49.940 --> 00:08:52.280
<i>That's why Kiriha said that to me.</i>

00:08:53.080 --> 00:08:57.160
<i>Because he always took out his own 
heart's weakness on the Digital World,</i>

00:08:57.160 --> 00:08:58.940
<i>he understood what Yuu felt.</i>

00:08:58.940 --> 00:09:00.620
<i>He entrusted Yuu to me!</i>

00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:04.390
Oh? You feel a bit more motivated now?

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:06.020
A bit?

00:09:06.020 --> 00:09:07.190
Hardly!

00:09:08.680 --> 00:09:10.530
Why? It can't be!

00:09:10.530 --> 00:09:12.330
Oh... Taiki!

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:15.830
<i>I'll fight you for real!</i>

00:09:15.830 --> 00:09:17.700
<i>I'm the only one who can do that!</i>

00:09:19.800 --> 00:09:21.610
Xros Open!

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:26.960
SkullKnightmon!

00:09:29.560 --> 00:09:32.310
Go, DeadlyAxemon.

00:09:32.310 --> 00:09:33.850
To the Black castle.

00:09:33.850 --> 00:09:35.450
Our victory is already assured,

00:09:35.450 --> 00:09:39.680
but Yuu might slip up 
against Taiki Kudou.

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:41.810
Back him up, just in case.

00:09:43.630 --> 00:09:46.310
Nene, you failed to follow through.

00:09:46.310 --> 00:09:50.440
It seems that you've reached 
your limit as Yuu's substitute.

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:53.030
I am grateful to you.

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:55.030
You were a tremendous help

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:57.540
when I was developing 
the Darkness Loader.

00:09:58.170 --> 00:10:00.900
But you never realized that Yuu,

00:10:00.900 --> 00:10:04.950
the one you were trying to save, 
was my most valuable pawn.

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:07.050
I will save Yuu! No matter what!

00:10:07.050 --> 00:10:10.730
That won't be possible. 
You will disappear here.

00:10:10.730 --> 00:10:13.920
You finally learned how to use X5,

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:16.530
but it was all for nothing.

00:10:16.530 --> 00:10:17.910
X5?

00:10:18.600 --> 00:10:22.820
It looks to me like that's 
X4 you're stepping on.

00:10:22.820 --> 00:10:24.400
What?

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:29.340
You brat! When did you...

00:10:29.340 --> 00:10:31.660
I won't let you make Nene sad anymore!

00:10:33.540 --> 00:10:36.030
Now's our chance, Nene! One more shot!

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:36.650
Yeah!

00:10:38.980 --> 00:10:40.720
Sparrowmon!

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:43.840
Shoutmon X4!

00:10:44.150 --> 00:10:46.060
DigiXros!

00:10:46.060 --> 00:10:47.630
DigiXros!

00:11:00.770 --> 00:11:03.210
Shoutmon X5!

00:11:06.900 --> 00:11:09.780
I've failed! How could 
I be fooled by them?!

00:11:09.780 --> 00:11:12.890
You wanna know? Then I'll tell you.

00:11:12.890 --> 00:11:15.130
This is what we call our "bond."

00:11:15.130 --> 00:11:16.150
Bond?

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:19.730
You don't trust anyone, not even Yuu.

00:11:19.730 --> 00:11:22.530
That's why you sent 
DeadlyAxemon to him, isn't it?

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:27.970
We believe wholeheartedly 
in each other's abilities!

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:29.270
Take some of this!

00:11:29.610 --> 00:11:31.320
Meteor Impact!

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:39.880
Take some of this!

00:11:40.220 --> 00:11:41.930
Meteor Impact!

00:11:46.060 --> 00:11:48.720
That's it. Our counterattack has begun.

00:11:48.720 --> 00:11:50.660
Holding out this long was worth it.

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:53.060
You return to the castle, Mervamon.

00:11:53.060 --> 00:11:56.390
I'll break through their encirclement 
and raid the enemy camp.

00:11:56.390 --> 00:11:58.200
But if you go alone...

00:11:58.200 --> 00:12:00.480
I'll be fine. I have a plan.

00:12:00.480 --> 00:12:04.100
Besides, I have a duty 
to settle this score.

00:12:04.490 --> 00:12:08.240
Lilithmon is my sworn enemy, 
who destroyed my homeland.

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:13.190
Taiki gave me back the life that 
she took from me in our battle.

00:12:22.350 --> 00:12:25.360
This life won't disappear 
until I've defeated her.

00:12:25.360 --> 00:12:27.560
Trust me, and leave this to me.

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:31.360
All right. Don't overdo it, Beelzebumon.

00:12:32.830 --> 00:12:35.000
I'll do just that.

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:38.370
I won't let you get away!

00:12:40.640 --> 00:12:42.400
Death the Cannon!

00:12:45.940 --> 00:12:50.460
Not good enough! Now let the 
venom in my claws kill you again!

00:12:52.900 --> 00:12:55.450
Why, you!

00:12:55.450 --> 00:12:56.770
My turn!

00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:02.230
Beelzebumon!

00:13:02.830 --> 00:13:04.350
Impact Laser!

00:13:14.470 --> 00:13:15.610
Mervamon!

00:13:15.610 --> 00:13:18.970
I'll take over here! Go to Yuu!

00:13:19.840 --> 00:13:21.230
DigiXros!

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:23.750
Apollomon Darkness Mode!

00:13:35.320 --> 00:13:38.300
How ridiculous, to be 
thwarted by such weaklings.

00:13:38.300 --> 00:13:41.940
If Apollomon hadn't put 
this seal on his right arm,

00:13:41.940 --> 00:13:45.030
I could have taken care 
of them much quicker.

00:13:46.440 --> 00:13:48.810
And what is the holdup over here?

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:54.410
<i>What is Taiki trying to do?</i>

00:13:54.410 --> 00:13:56.080
<i>He's only attacking my weapon!</i>

00:14:01.590 --> 00:14:04.870
You see? It hurts, doesn't it?

00:14:04.870 --> 00:14:07.000
This fight is not a game.

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:11.160
It's just as real as our 
own human world, Yuu!

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:13.010
That's a lie!

00:14:13.010 --> 00:14:15.220
The Digital World is a world of data!

00:14:15.220 --> 00:14:18.500
This pain is fake, designed 
to make it feel more real!

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:23.850
You're wrong, Yuu.

00:14:24.500 --> 00:14:28.580
At the very least, 
we humans really exist here.

00:14:28.580 --> 00:14:31.340
I went back to the human 
world for a while,

00:14:31.340 --> 00:14:35.340
and the injuries I had from my 
previous battles remained.

00:14:36.220 --> 00:14:38.780
So, if either of us loses here...

00:14:39.850 --> 00:14:42.360
we will die.

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:49.170
No! Sir Yuu can't know about that!

00:14:49.530 --> 00:14:50.610
You!

00:14:50.610 --> 00:14:52.950
Hang in there, MetalGreymon!

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:54.070
You're late.

00:14:55.840 --> 00:14:58.720
It's the same for the Digimon.

00:14:58.720 --> 00:15:01.010
When they're injured, 
they feel pain. They feel sad.

00:15:01.010 --> 00:15:03.750
There's no world you can 
live in without all that.

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:04.740
You're lying!

00:15:04.740 --> 00:15:06.020
It's the truth, Yuu.

00:15:07.620 --> 00:15:08.950
Sis!

00:15:08.950 --> 00:15:12.520
I didn't get to finish telling 
you in Honey Land...

00:15:12.520 --> 00:15:13.520
So I'll tell you again.

00:15:13.860 --> 00:15:15.950
Digimon are not just data.

00:15:15.950 --> 00:15:17.840
They're our friends.

00:15:17.840 --> 00:15:21.550
They're no different from our friends and 
all living things in the human world.

00:15:21.550 --> 00:15:23.500
That's why I came back here.

00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:25.300
To save the Digital World.

00:15:25.810 --> 00:15:28.250
The creatures here aren't just data.

00:15:28.250 --> 00:15:30.350
They're my precious friends.

00:15:30.350 --> 00:15:34.010
Friends who laugh and cry for my sake.

00:15:35.820 --> 00:15:37.080
You're lying!

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:42.610
If that's true, then if I win here, 
won't I really kill you and my sister?

00:15:42.610 --> 00:15:46.370
Wouldn't Tuwarmon and the others 
really disappear if they lost?

00:15:46.370 --> 00:15:47.730
I don't want that!

00:15:48.060 --> 00:15:49.620
Then don't fight.

00:15:49.620 --> 00:15:53.280
You're being deceived by DarkKnightmon.

00:15:53.280 --> 00:15:57.370
He's taking advantage of the kindness 
and weakness in your heart!

00:15:59.140 --> 00:16:01.410
Fight the reality, Yuu!

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:04.280
Let's go back to the human world.

00:16:04.590 --> 00:16:07.080
I don't want that either!

00:16:07.080 --> 00:16:09.430
I like this world!

00:16:09.430 --> 00:16:11.910
I want to keep fighting here longer!

00:16:11.910 --> 00:16:15.030
Tuwarmon! Absorb all the 
Digimon in this area,

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:17.660
and the powers of hell along with them!

00:16:17.990 --> 00:16:20.360
Darkness Loader! DigiXros!

00:16:20.360 --> 00:16:22.450
With pleasure! DigiXros!

00:16:33.810 --> 00:16:35.910
Lord Apollomon!

00:16:37.620 --> 00:16:40.670
This is the original Darkness Loader.

00:16:40.670 --> 00:16:44.820
So the ones we all have are prototypes?

00:16:44.820 --> 00:16:47.550
I can't get caught up in this.

00:16:52.150 --> 00:16:54.930
DeadlyTuwarmon Hell Mode!

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:02.320
Yuu!

00:17:02.320 --> 00:17:04.500
We have to at least save Yuu somehow!

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:07.740
Then leave this to me, Taiki!

00:17:08.430 --> 00:17:09.470
Shoutmon!

00:17:09.790 --> 00:17:11.510
Digivolve!

00:17:12.910 --> 00:17:15.510
Shoutmon, Digivolve!

00:17:18.750 --> 00:17:20.450
OmegaShoutmon!

00:17:22.720 --> 00:17:24.860
Everyone attack in waves!

00:17:24.860 --> 00:17:26.460
Heavy Speaker!

00:17:26.460 --> 00:17:28.730
Drill Buster!

00:17:28.730 --> 00:17:31.830
Meteor Storm!

00:17:32.500 --> 00:17:34.530
Random Laser!

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:35.830
Now, Shoutmon!

00:17:35.830 --> 00:17:36.800
Right!

00:17:40.470 --> 00:17:42.700
I will not give Sir Yuu to anyone!

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:44.280
Burning Boogie!

00:17:46.010 --> 00:17:50.650
Well? You can't do anything with 
the forces you have left, can you?

00:17:50.650 --> 00:17:53.450
My game isn't over yet!

00:17:53.450 --> 00:17:55.020
Nobody can stop me!

00:18:03.890 --> 00:18:05.650
<i>It's the same for the Digimon.</i>

00:18:05.650 --> 00:18:08.090
<i>When they're injured, 
they feel pain. They feel sad.</i>

00:18:08.090 --> 00:18:10.110
That can't be true!

00:18:10.110 --> 00:18:10.800
Let's finish them!

00:18:10.800 --> 00:18:12.880
Do it, Tuwarmon!

00:18:12.880 --> 00:18:14.010
With pleasure!

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:22.380
What?! When did he Digivolve?!

00:18:22.900 --> 00:18:24.750
I thought I told you, Yuu!

00:18:25.120 --> 00:18:25.980
Kiriha!

00:18:25.980 --> 00:18:27.590
This fight is real!

00:18:27.590 --> 00:18:29.690
Unexpected miracles can happen!

00:18:29.690 --> 00:18:32.610
Kiriha! But... you're 
supposed to be dead!

00:18:33.570 --> 00:18:36.560
No! The seven Digimon here are...

00:18:39.160 --> 00:18:40.900
Let's go, Taiki! Nene!

00:18:41.200 --> 00:18:42.070
Yeah!

00:18:42.570 --> 00:18:44.200
Great Xros!

00:18:48.110 --> 00:18:49.580
OmegaShoutmon!

00:18:49.580 --> 00:18:50.440
Right!

00:18:50.640 --> 00:18:52.200
ZekeGreymon!

00:18:53.310 --> 00:18:54.610
Ballistamon!

00:18:56.050 --> 00:18:57.320
Dorulumon!

00:18:58.880 --> 00:18:59.990
Starmons!

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:01.270
Yes!

00:19:02.450 --> 00:19:04.160
Sparrowmon!

00:19:05.820 --> 00:19:07.530
Great Xros!

00:19:28.030 --> 00:19:31.270
Shoutmon X7!

00:19:50.530 --> 00:19:52.980
Tuwarmon's acting hurt...

00:19:52.980 --> 00:19:55.470
Is that real pain he's feeling?

00:19:55.890 --> 00:19:58.840
No... I mustn't upset Sir Yuu!

00:19:59.720 --> 00:20:01.710
Hell's Mantis Dance!

00:20:01.710 --> 00:20:05.520
Xros Burning Rocker!

00:20:16.780 --> 00:20:18.200
I can't hold out any longer!

00:20:18.200 --> 00:20:20.600
I'll use Xros Open to escape!

00:20:23.570 --> 00:20:24.370
Yuu!

00:20:24.370 --> 00:20:25.140
He got away!

00:20:36.890 --> 00:20:40.880
To think the Admiral's most 
favored General could lose.

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:43.790
I was right to desert him.

00:20:43.790 --> 00:20:47.290
Now, then... what shall I do with them?

00:20:52.470 --> 00:20:53.830
Did you figure anything out?

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:56.700
Yeah. It's just a feeling, but...

00:20:56.700 --> 00:20:58.700
I think watching Yuu made me realize...

00:20:58.700 --> 00:21:00.870
what I was lacking.

00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:02.570
I see.

00:21:02.870 --> 00:21:06.350
Well, now we just have to get 
Yuu back and get out of here.

00:21:06.350 --> 00:21:09.100
Hold on a minute! 
Beelzebumon's not here!

00:21:09.100 --> 00:21:11.430
He faced the enemy head-on to protect me!

00:21:11.430 --> 00:21:13.580
Beelzebumon's over there, look.

00:21:15.550 --> 00:21:17.590
He's immortal, you know.

00:21:17.590 --> 00:21:20.740
Wh-What's he acting all tough for?

00:21:20.740 --> 00:21:22.330
I shouldn't have worried about him.

00:21:24.550 --> 00:21:29.910
But Yuu said none of us can leave 
here until either he or I get killed.

00:21:29.910 --> 00:21:32.740
If that's true, what should we do?

00:21:54.830 --> 00:21:57.450
If you lose, will you die?

00:21:57.450 --> 00:21:59.600
Will you really die?

00:21:59.600 --> 00:22:01.800
Sir Yuu...

00:22:07.820 --> 00:22:09.790
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:22:09.790 --> 00:22:13.330
<b>Digimon Data Collection</b>

00:22:10.760 --> 00:22:13.330
Digimon Data Collection!

00:22:13.330 --> 00:22:17.250
<b>Listen to the Digimon's melody!</b>

00:22:13.860 --> 00:22:17.250
Listen to the melody of 
this Digimon I caught!

00:22:14.250 --> 00:22:15.250
<b>Melody starts in 3 seconds.</b>

00:22:15.250 --> 00:22:16.250
<b>Melody starts in 2 seconds.</b>

00:22:16.250 --> 00:22:17.250
<b>Melody starts in 1 second.</b>

00:22:19.950 --> 00:22:33.500
<b>[Type]</b>

00:22:22.290 --> 00:22:39.670
<b>Plant Type</b>

00:22:23.120 --> 00:22:33.500
<b>[Attack]</b>

00:22:24.690 --> 00:22:39.670
<b>Poison Ivy</b>

00:22:27.230 --> 00:22:28.190
Palmon.

00:22:28.190 --> 00:22:31.390
Her attack uses vines to 
paralyze the opponent,

00:22:31.390 --> 00:22:33.510
Poison Ivy.

00:22:33.510 --> 00:22:36.230
Her tropical hairstyle is so cute!

00:22:36.230 --> 00:22:39.670
Aloha 'oe!

00:22:40.840 --> 00:22:43.880
Lilithmon is destroying Hell's Field!

00:22:43.880 --> 00:22:46.170
I'll put my life on the 
line for my friends!

00:22:46.170 --> 00:22:49.090
Taiki, I'll always be with you.

00:22:49.090 --> 00:22:50.930
Beelzebumon!

00:22:50.930 --> 00:22:52.320
Digimon Xros Wars!

00:22:52.320 --> 00:22:54.500
<b>Beelzebumon Vanishes Into the Light!</b>

00:22:52.690 --> 00:22:54.550
You can't turn your back 
on the next one, either!
